# External Claude Code skills — installed via `npx skills add <source>`
# Format: one source per line (npm package, GitHub slug, or full URL).
# bootstrap.sh reads this and creates ~/.agents/skills/ + symlinks into
# ~/.claude/skills/ (visible as `caveman`, `find-skills`, `code-overhaul-review`).
#
# In-repo skills (committed dirs under ~/dotfiles/.claude/skills/) are NOT
# listed here — they ship as-is via dotfiles symlink. Currently:
#   graphify, plannotator-*, seo, shopify-theme-development, style-review,
#   typescript-advanced-types, vite, writing
ehmo/caveman-skill
ehmo/find-skills-skill
ehmo/code-overhaul-skill
